0 Watt's Line - a rotating linkage draws a nearly straight path
0 Name: watt-line.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/watt-line.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One hub; one direct-drive motor A; no custom parts or imposed output path.
0 // O=(0,0), D=(200,80), OB=DC=100, BC=80 LDU in the XZ plane.
0 // Saved datum: input +X; coupler +Z. Operating input +/-20 degrees.
0 // Orange rails are physical stops before the negative-angle toggle.
0 // Battery 45610 additional; route integral cable behind motor to hub.
0 // Motor cradle adapted from corrected Quickstroke / Pantograph Doubler.
